      "writtenOn": "2018-12-13T13:33:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah ok, if your goal was to not make that part of the API this seems fine. I think I\u0027d lean more towards factory methods, since requesting bugreports is not a typical usecase on an end-users device? But if this will likely change anyway, it probably doesn\u0027t matter too much.",
